\par\par \b \uc2  China yuan inches down at close but seen firming. \b0\par\par\uc2 575 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 2000\par 05:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Nov 7 (Reuters) - China's yuan ended a notch weaker on Tuesday due to slightly more dollar buying by importers in the last 10 minutes of trade, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But the yuan had been firming for most of the session due to persistent dollar selling from exporters, indicating the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to strengthen in the near term, they said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed at an intraday low of 8.2775 to the dollar, compared with 8.2774 on Monday. It had risen to an intraday high of 8.2766 and stood there until last few minutes of trading. \par \par \uc2  Turnover fell to $150 million from Monday's $190 million, according to figures published on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.chinamoney.com.cn/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.chinamoney.com.cn}}}\uc2 , China \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trade System's website. \par \par \uc2  "There were two transactions in which importers bought dollars in the last 10 minutes of trading, pushing the yuan to close slightly weaker," said a dealer at a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  "But the yuan had risen for most of the session today and is likely to tread stronger in the near term," he said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan has been strong recently as Chinese firms usually export more goods to western countries in October and November to meet strong demand during the Christmas and New Year seasons. \par \par \uc2  China's yuan is convertible only on the current account. Banks usually settle their \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions on the national market after trading the yuan with their corporate clients, mostly importers and exporters. \par \par \uc2  "We have seen more dollar settlement demand from local exporters in the past few weeks as the fourth quarter is usually an export peak period for China," said a local bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there were no signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday despite yuan's strength during the session. The bank has acted to enforce a thin trading band of 8.2770 and 8.2800 over the past three years. \par \par \uc2  Last Friday, the yuan strayed out of the range for the first time since June to end at 8.2668 after strong dollar selling by exporters boosted the yuan for six straight sessions. The previous time it ended outside the band was on June 23 at 8.2767. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was probably quietly testing market reaction to a wider trading band, having reduced its activity and allowed the yuan to close out of the normal thin band more than a dozen times since mid-April. \par \par \uc2  Officials say the government is studying plans to widen the trading band, but do not give any timetable. \par \par \uc2  In a Reuters poll of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  experts in July, six of 10 respondents said China would allow the yuan to trade in a broader range of at least plus or minus five percent by the end of 2001. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the yuan was likely to rise again in the next few sessions, possibly breaching the 8.2770 level again. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might allow the yuan to move beyond the 8.2770 level, but was likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it breached 8.2764, the highest closing level since the market was set up in 1994, set on May 24 this year. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the yuan strengthened against the yen to close at 7.6941 to 100 yen versus Monday's 7.7117. It also ended firmer against the Hong Kong dollar at 1.0606 from 1.0610. \par \par \uc2  . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dwb702ghz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
