\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  yuan strong,  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention \highlight\uc2  seen. \b0\par\par\uc2 532 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 2000\par 05:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Nov 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's yuan firmed against the U.S. dollar on Thursday, ending at the edge of its long-standing trading band and logging gains for the fifth straight session on exporter selling of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The yuan ended at 8.2770, the strong end of the long-standing trading band of 8.2770 and 8.2800 that the central People's Bank of China has enforced for nearly three years. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed at 8.2772 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there were signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action to prevent the yuan from closing outside its wafer-thin band after it touched an intraday high of 8.2768 in late trade. The yuan's session low was 8.2774. \par \par \uc2  "There were few banks buying dollars, so the yuan kept rising through most of the trading session," said a local bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  "But minutes before the market close, dollar buying orders kept coming in at the 8.2770 level, and very likely it was the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  who did this," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Though the yuan is still under tight government grip, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has become less active in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the past six months and the yuan has closed outside the band more than a dozen times since mid-April. \par \par \uc2  Officials say China is expected to move towards a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime eventually, partly to counter the impact on trade of its entry to the World Trade Organisation. \par \par \uc2  In September, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Dai Xianglong said Beijing would consider widening the yuan trading band if necessary, but changes would not be major. He gave no timetable. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they were not surprised at the renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday because Beijing was not expected to officially give the yuan more flexibility this year. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was only testing the waters when it allowed the yuan to close outside its band earlier this year, they said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say China was unlikely to loosen its grip on the yuan until the impact of WTO on the country's trade performance became clear and this could take at least a year after entry. \par \par \uc2  China expects to join the global trade body in a few months. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the firming of the yuan, convertible only on the current account, since early October could have been helped by an apparent pick-up in China's exports. \par \par \uc2  Chinese companies usually export more goods to western countries in October and November to meet strong demand during the Christmas and New Year seasons, they said. \par \par \uc2  But some dealers said China's higher-than-expected economic growth was expected to drive up imports and put pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  going forward. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yuan turnover waned further to a moderate $180 million on Thursday from $200 million in the previous session, according to figures published on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.chinamoney.com.cn/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.chinamoney.com.cn}}}\uc2 , China \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trade System's website. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the yuan weakened against the yen to close at 7.6580 versus Wednesday's 7.6050. It closed unchanged for the second straight session at 1.0610 to the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dwb202z4d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
