\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  seen easing  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  on yuan - paper. \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2000\par 11:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, July 12 (Reuters) - The central People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  is relaxing its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy in an effort to allow the yuan to bend more to market forces, the Economic Daily said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The article appeared to be an indirect acknowledgement - the first in the official media - of analyst views that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is testing a wider trading range for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of China's entry to the World Trade Organisation. \par \par \uc2  "The recent yuan performance only indicates the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is gradually easing the strength and frequency of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the newspaper said. \par \par \uc2  "This reflects the bank's confidence in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and its will to leave the yuan more with market forces," it said. \par \par \uc2  Since May 23, China's yuan, convertible only on the current account, has closed outside its usual tiny band of 8.2770 and 8.2800 a dozen times within one month. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the yuan in that tight range. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there had been no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the tightly controlled market since May 19. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say China needs a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime to absorb shocks likely to brought on by its WTO entry, expected this year. \par \par \uc2  ((Shanghai Newsroom: (86) 21-6355-4009; Fax 21-6355-5015; reutersh@uninet.com.cn)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw7c01ygu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
