\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Sour as dollar/yen creeps higher. \b0\par\par\uc2 942 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 2000\par 03:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Feb 24 (Reuters) - Overnight strength in the \par \par \uc2  dollar after reassuring comments by U.S. Fed Chairman Alan \par \par \uc2  Greenspan weighed on regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the Singapore \par \par \uc2  dollar showed little reaction to economic data. \par \par \uc2      Greenspan said during the second leg of his \par \par \uc2  Humphrey-Hawkins testimony that monetary policy was not aimed \par \par \uc2  at keeping stock prices in check. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     In early Asian trading, the yen\tab     remained broadly\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lower as Japanese investors unwound hedge positions against\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par both the dollar and the euro\tab    .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     There was no immediate reaction to affirmation by Thomson\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Financial that it would stick to Japan's AAA sovereign risk\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rating and that it might downgrade it if Japanese growth did\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par not pick up next year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Euro/yen\tab \tab  was well-bid in line with its recent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recovery amid optimism about Europe's economic outlook and talk\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of higher euro-zone rates.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Singapore dollar was slightly easier after breaking\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par through key support of 1.7110 on Wednesday on fears of\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the monetary authorities.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     There was no visible reaction to full-year 1999 and fourth\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quarter GDP data which met analysts' average expectations.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     GDP grew 5.4 percent for all of 1999 and 7.1 percent in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yaer to the fourth quarter.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     For now, local banks were seen selling dollar/Sing at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around 1.7145-50 while players kept a wary eye on potential\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par upside in dollar/yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "I think it (dollar/Sing) should trade between 1.7120-50\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for rest of day unless there's a pickup in dollar/yen. If that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par gets to 112 then everything else will follow. And the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar/Sing could go to 1.72," a dealer from a European bank\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore (MAS)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par would probably \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the dollar/Sing reached around\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.7210-20.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TAIWAN DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar was steady early after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday in after \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's recent ultimatum that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the island enter peace talks or face attack.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  slipped nearly nine Taiwan cents on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tuesday and stocks fell as well.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Taipei dealers said they expected a T$30.75-T$30.80 range\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the rest of the day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     All eyes were on dollar/yen as more yen downside would\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par weigh on the Taiwan unit as Japan and Taiwan compete in similar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par export markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     THAI BAHT\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The baht was slightly softer due to sporadic dollar demand\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from importers and interbank players.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said baht gains the previous day were partly caused\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par by a baht liquidity squeeze in the offshore market which forced\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par some players to unwind dollars.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But the unit was expected to move in a narrow range in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par absence of strong commercial demand and fresh leads, they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The next barrier for dollar/baht was seen at 38.40, while\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 37.80 offered solid support as players were expected to buy on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dips at that level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIA RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah nudged higher on buying orders from some Asian\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par names.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     New \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reporting rules have had a limited\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par impact on the market so far. Bank Indonesia said on Wednesday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that commercial banks must begin submitting monthly reports on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  deals from April.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par They are required to submit details including parties\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par involved and the relationship among the parties involved for\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par deals above $10,000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On the asset sales front, the Indonesian Bank Restructuring\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Agency (IBRA) has delayed a planned IPO for shares in Bank\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Central Asia (BCA) until the new fiscal year from April.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The sale was due before end-March and is an important\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par element in the government's revenue targets for the current\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fiscal year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso was weaker against the dollar as it tracked other\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  lower, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The only thing supporting the peso is the absence of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par onshore dollar demand so that's keeping it well supported," a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealer at a U.S bank said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The peso was likely to trade in a narrow 40.65 to 40.80\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par range for the rest of the day, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Volume at the open was thin compared to around the same\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par time the previous day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON\tab      -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won weakened further as the yen failed to hold onto its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par strength against the dollar in overseas markets, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Market players, including offshore operators, were seen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par buying dollars early in the morning after the greenback pushed\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  back to the 111 yen level," said a dealer\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from a foreign bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Bank of Korea releases provisional 1999 current account\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par figures at 0400 GMT. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  forecast the 1999 figure\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at $26 billion against $40.6 billion in 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. $0138 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     111.39\tab  110.62\tab    -0.69\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7119\tab  1.7091\tab    -0.16\par  Taiwan dlr     30.78\tab   30.79\tab    +0.03\par  Korean won   1138.50\tab 1135.00\tab    -0.31\par  Baht\tab      38.10\tab   38.03\tab    -0.18\par  Peso\tab      40.73\tab   40.68\tab    -0.12\par  Rupiah\tab  7440.00\tab 7440.00\tab    +0.00\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     111.39\tab  102.21\tab    -8.24\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7119\tab  1.6640\tab    -2.80\par  Taiwan dlr     30.78\tab   31.38\tab    +1.95\par  Korean won   1138.50\tab 1135.00\tab    -0.31\par  Baht\tab      38.10\tab   37.45\tab    -1.71\par  Peso\tab      40.73\tab   40.20\tab    -1.30\par  Rupiah\tab  7440.00\tab 6975.00\tab    -6.25\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Desk (65) 870-3087\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par email:asia.\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 @reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C