\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 ; Rupiah Hits Post-Poll Low In Mkt Panic \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1999\par 10:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Position liquidation by investors in Indonesia turned into full-fledged panic selling of the rupiah Wednesday, driving the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down by as much as 9.5% at one point to hit its post-election low. \par \par \uc2  The scare spread to other regional markets, driving the Thai baht to a four-month low and pushing the Philippine peso down sharply. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar managed to hold its own on the day, although choppy intraday trading did see it retreat from the seven-month high it hit the night before. \par \par \uc2  In North Asia, the South Korean won softened as investors reacted negatively to news that the announcement of a proposed restructuring plan for the Daewoo Group had been delayed. \par \par \uc2  The New Taiwan dollar ended relatively little changed, steadied by the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's threats of military action against the island. \par \par \uc2  In Southeast Asia, sales of the rupiah by investors looking to withdraw their funds from Indonesia, and by short-term traders looking to piggyback on the outflows, accelerated sharply Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Singapore reported unusually heavy trading volumes, estimating that as much as $1 billion changed hands in less than two days. The panic bidding forced the U.S. dollar to a high of IDR8,100 Wednesday - its highest level since June 4, the last trading session before Indonesia's parliamentary elections June 7. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 11-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0830GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8b05z7s\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (china near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw)and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Quelle\cell \pard \ql \li0\r